 CLI, bringing producer-side project and document caching. Extend the existing engine integration journey to compare project-read results and requests with caching enabled and disabled, retaining its write-back and recovery coverage.\n\n## Why\n\nManagers need the same fresh, quota-saving store behavior in dispatched graph work and the read API as in standalone board reads.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking dependency update: public plan/store types expose the producer\u2019s changed Project, Document, and VersionCoverage surface. Existing gh2 task versions require another read after the move to gh3. Engine reads remain unpinned and versions remain opaque; no engine-side cache or token translation is added.", "changed_files": 4, "closed_at": "2026-10-15T20:39:43Z", "comments": 1, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/942/comments", "commits": 1, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/942/commits", "created_at": "2026-10-15T18:00:44Z", "deletions": 25, "diff_url": "https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/942.diff", "draft": false, "head": {"label": "nickderobertis:nick/913/link-cache-engine", "ref": "nick/913/link-cache-engine", "repo": {"allow_forking": true, "archive_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/{archive_format}{/ref}", "archived": false, "assignees_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/assignees{/user}", "blobs_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/git/blobs{/sha}", "branches_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/branches{/branch}", "clone_url": "https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline.git", "collaborators_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/collaborators{/collaborator}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/comments{/number}", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/